OL,3,GNEWSA'A life cut short': No ambulances
OL,4,Aavailable for man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driving instructor died of a cardiac
OL,7,Farrest after his wife had to take him
OL,8,Fto hospital in rush hour traffic
OL,9,Fbecause no ambulances were available.
OL,11,FAn inquest heard how three emergency
OL,12,Fcalls were made when David Mann fell
OL,13,Fill during a lesson, but ambulances
OL,14,Fwere stuck outside hospitals waiting to
OL,15,Fhand over patients.
OL,17,FThe Worcestershire coroner has written
OL,18,Fto the health secretary and NHS England
OL,19,Fto try to prevent future deaths. David
OL,20,FReid said lives were being put at risk
OL,21,Fdue to ambulances being held up outside
OL,22,Fhospitals when no beds were available.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
