OL,3,GNEWSA'A life cut short': No ambulances
OL,4,Aavailable for man
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said it
OL,7,Fhad the worst hospital handover delays
OL,8,Fin England and Wales and was working
OL,9,Fwith hospitals to reduce this.
